<library name="BAS70-04_SOT23">
<description>&lt;b&gt;Nexperia BAS70-04 dual-series Schottky diode&lt;/b&gt;&lt;p&gt;
Mouser 771-BAS70-04 family, SOT23 (TO-236AB). The schematic symbol shows both Schottky diodes, the internal K1/A2 junction, and physical pins 1, 2, and 3.
</description>
<packages>
<package name="SOT23-3_NEXPERIA">
<description>&lt;b&gt;Nexperia SOT23 / TO-236AB, 3 terminals&lt;/b&gt;&lt;p&gt;
Pin 1 lower left, pin 2 lower right, pin 3 upper center. Reflow lands are 0.70 x 0.60 mm, with 1.90 mm pin 1-to-2 pitch and 2.30 mm row-center spacing, matching the Nexperia SOT23 reflow recommendation.
</description>
