<library name="Vishay_ORNTA1002QT1_Invokable">
<description>
Vishay Dale Thin Film ORNTA1002QT1 matched resistor network.
A-circuit: four isolated, nominally equal 10 kΩ resistors.
Absolute tolerance ±0.05%; ratio tolerance ±0.01%.
JEDEC MS-012 AA, 1.27 mm pitch SOIC-8.

All four resistor gates use EAGLE addlevel CAN. Add the device once, then use
INVOKE on the same RN device to place any of the remaining resistor sections.

Pin pairing follows the Vishay A-circuit datasheet:
A = pins 1-8
B = pins 2-7
C = pins 3-6
D = pins 4-5
      </description>
<packages>
<package name="SOIC8_MS012_AA_1.27MM">
<description>
JEDEC MS-012 AA footprint for Vishay ORNT series.
Datasheet body: 4.90 x 3.90 mm nominal, 6.00 mm nominal lead span,
1.27 mm lead pitch, 1.73 mm max seated height.
          </description>
