<library name="KEMET_C315_1pF_C0G_10.16mm_BentLead">
<description>
&lt;b&gt;KEMET C315C109D2G5TA — modified PCB footprint&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br/&gt;
1 pF, 200 V, C0G/NP0 radial MLCC.&lt;br/&gt;
Native capacitor lead spacing is 2.54 mm, but this footprint intentionally spaces the PCB holes
&lt;b&gt;10.16 mm (0.400 in)&lt;/b&gt; apart to match the Ohmite SM102031007FE 1 GΩ resistor.
The capacitor leads are intended to be gently formed outward before insertion.
</description>
<packages>
<package name="C315_BENT_10.16MM">
<description>
KEMET C315 radial capacitor with user-formed leads for 10.16 mm PCB hole spacing.
Actual body approx. 3.81 mm x 3.14 mm; lead diameter approx. 0.51 mm.
Pads are 10.16 mm center-to-center with 0.9 mm drills.
</description>
